applied, proposed 1 time: an Optional tested by hand then unwrapped with get() (o.isPresent()&&o.get().equals(x), o.isEmpty()?d:f(o.get()), a.isEmpty()?b:a) becomes one Optional expression (o.equals(Optional.of(x)), o.map(f).orElse(d), a.or(..), flatMap); early-return guards stay
